Hi
Well, I would prefer tapply so I will let **you** construct for loop 
for the calculation.

x <- rpois(100, 3)
y <- rep(1:ceiling(length(x)/12),each=12)
tapply(x,y[1:100],sum)
 1  2  3  4  5  6  7  8  9 
38 37 40 29 36 31 47 46 16 

HTH
Petr

