Hello Stuart,

here is a way using "model.matrix", the "-1" is to remove the intercept.

ttt <- data.frame(ttt = factor(sample(0:4, 100, replace = T)))
names(ttt)
model.matrix(~ ttt, data = ttt)[, -1]

Have fun,

